000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. OCCURS2.
000030 DATA DIVISION.
000040 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000050 01  ITEM-COUNT        PIC 99      VALUE 3.
000060 01  ORDER-REC.
000070     05  CUSTOMER      PIC X(6)    VALUE "BAKER".
000080     05  ITEM          PIC X(4)    OCCURS 1 TO 10 TIMES
000090                       DEPENDING ON ITEM-COUNT
000100                       INDEXED BY IX.
000110 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000120     MOVE "PENS" TO ITEM(1)
000130     MOVE "INK " TO ITEM(2)
000140     MOVE "PADS" TO ITEM(3)
000150     DISPLAY "3 ITEMS: [" ORDER-REC "] " LENGTH OF ORDER-REC
000160     MOVE 5 TO ITEM-COUNT
000170     MOVE "TAPE" TO ITEM(4)
000180     MOVE "GLUE" TO ITEM(5)
000190     DISPLAY "5 ITEMS: [" ORDER-REC "] " LENGTH OF ORDER-REC
000200     PERFORM VARYING IX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL IX > ITEM-COUNT
000210         DISPLAY "  ITEM " ITEM(IX)
000220     END-PERFORM
000230     SET IX TO 2
000240     SET IX UP BY 1
000250     DISPLAY "ITEM(IX) WITH IX = 3: " ITEM(IX)
000260     DISPLAY "ITEM(IX + 1): " ITEM(IX + 1)
000270     STOP RUN.
